    "group": "Changehost of Deceit",
    "summary": "This rule grants two auras:\n\n- Your **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** units have **Daemonic Illusions (Aura)**: friendly **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** units **visible** to and within 6\" of such a unit get a 4+ invulnerable save versus ranged attacks.\n- Your **THOUSAND SONS** units have **Mortal Sorcery (Aura)**: friendly **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS PSYKER** units visible to and within 6\" of such a unit have [Cabal of Sorcerers](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.cabal-of-sorcerers).",
